# Reference typefaces lifted from other apps' bundles while the design system was
# being worked out. Only Inter (SIL OFL) is licensed to redistribute, and it is the
# only one the build loads - see the single @font-face in packages/web/src/styles.css.
packages/web/public/fonts/*
!packages/web/public/fonts/Inter-Variable.woff2
